{"id":313,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"自由な学びと挑戦を広げる大阪明星","feature_description":"大阪明星学園 明星中学校・明星高等学校は、学問にとらわれない自由な学びと挑戦を掲げ、グローバルスキルを育てる学校です。6ヵ年コースではS特進、特進、英数の各コースを設け、探究的な学びやサイエンス、テクノロジーにも触れられるようにしています。進路実現と主体性の両立が見えやすいです。公式サイトの学校案内や教育ページが整理され、学びの方針と学校生活の両面を確認しやすいです。","clubs":[{"id":5638,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.meisei.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5639,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.meisei.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5640,"name":"ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.meisei.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5641,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.meisei.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5642,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.meisei.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5643,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.meisei.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5644,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.meisei.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5645,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.meisei.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5646,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.meisei.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5647,"name":"応援部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.meisei.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5648,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.meisei.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5649,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.meisei.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5650,"name":"書道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.meisei.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5651,"name":"地歴部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.meisei.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5652,"name":"グリークラブ","category":"文化部",